<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan aluminium output, shipments rise yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan aluminium output, shipments rise yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products rose in January from the same month last year, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The December data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     Jan 97     yr/yr change    Dec 96 (revised)</p>
<p> Output	   193,023	+7.5 pct	 202,914</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   90,700	+3.6 pct	  94,990</p>
<p>   Extrusions   102,323     +11.3 pct	 107,924</p>
<p> Shipments	199,519	+8.9 pct	 200,264</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled   95,249	+4.6 pct	  91,936</p>
</text>
